Z||000000||Master_Sushi||08-29-2000||05:04 PM||||I found this page a while back and have been interested in there sunroof install. It says that its a completely stock sunroof install for 600$ canadian. Does it even come with the front storage compartment and is this a good price? I dont live to far from them. Im just wondering if anyone has any experiance with them, mostly sunroof installs  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. And if its a completely stock install. I also seem to remember then being on the fiero forum.<P>Thanks a bunch!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||5
